<title>USA: Franklin Mutual starts proxy solicitation.</title>
<headline>Franklin Mutual starts proxy solicitation.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Franklin Mutual Advisers Inc, a unit of Franklin Resources Inc, said Tuesday it has started the solicitation of proxies from shareholders of Telephone and Data Systems Inc for the election of its candidate for a seat on the board of directors.</p>
<p>&quot;In our view the Carlson family-controlled TDS is not being run today for the benefit of all shareholders,&quot; Franklin Mutual senior vice president Lawrence Sondike said in a statement. &quot;The market value of TDS shares doesn't reflect the values of the underlying businesses.&quot;</p>
</text>
